@startuml US009-SSD
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "User" as Actor
participant ":System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> System : requests account registration (email, password)
activate System

System -> System : validates email format, checks uniqueness, and hashes password
System -> System : persists User aggregate
System --> Actor : confirms successful account creation

deactivate System


Actor -> System : requests login (email, password)
activate System

System -> System : verifies email and compares password hash
System --> Actor : confirms successful authentication and returns session token



deactivate System
deactivate Actor

@enduml